OL,3,GNEWSATeen had leg amputated after
OL,4,Astabbing on beach on bank holiday,
OL,5,Acourt hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 17-year-old boy had to have his leg
OL,8,Famputated following an "unprovoked"
OL,9,Fstabbing during a bank holiday trip to
OL,10,FBarry Island.
OL,12,FNewport Crown Court heard that the boy,
OL,13,Fwho cannot be named because of his age,
OL,14,Fwas with a group of friends in May 2026
OL,15,Fwhen the incident happened.
OL,17,FIdris Ahmed attacked the teenager after
OL,18,Fhe acted "as a peacemaker" between two
OL,19,Fgroups before the altercation.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
