OL,3,GNEWSATeen had leg amputated after
OL,4,Astabbing on beach on bank holiday,
OL,5,Acourt hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 19-year-old from Riverside, Cardiff
OL,8,Fdenies one charge of grievous bodily
OL,9,Fharm with intent, one charge of
OL,10,Finflicting grievous bodily harm and a
OL,11,Fcharge of possessing a knife.
